{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISCERAL AND FOCUSED GUNPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot throws you into brutal combat where every bullet matters. Each freak you face needs its own brand of pain, and every shot pulls you one step closer to burying a bullet in the man who made you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t squander bullets and make each one hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/15b9db1b03b8c6a5102c97e0dea8bcf2.poster.avif?t=1765624507\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/15b9db1b03b8c6a5102c97e0dea8bcf2.webm?t=1765624507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSH &amp; PULL FOR MAXIMUM COLLATERAL DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear the freaks on your warpath limb from limb. Slam your cursed metal arm to unleash devastating shockwaves and drag your enemies right into the chaos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend the environment to your will and break anything that breathes and blocks you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/a21a66319711f98af4efbd6f959360f8.poster.avif?t=1765624507\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/a21a66319711f98af4efbd6f959360f8.webm?t=1765624507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE GROTESQUE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush twisted and grotesque bosses to carve a brutal path through the wreckage of your bloodline.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulverize and destroy every living thing before you, and rely on a son\u2019s fury to bring down even the colossal beasts that tower over you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/d55ea581ce44f79ab0e9d5e5d327cb1a.poster.avif?t=1765624507\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/d55ea581ce44f79ab0e9d5e5d327cb1a.webm?t=1765624507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR PATH IS A DARK ONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa Needs a Headshot is set in a nightmare dressed in gears and gunpowder. Your path is a dark one soaked in family blood, and somehow, you\u2019ll find a way to make it even darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/15b47925702b89f75f676d0ad5f2b1fc.poster.avif?t=1765624507\" width=609 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/extras/15b47925702b89f75f676d0ad5f2b1fc.webm?t=1765624507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845210?t=1765624507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/ac3d1ab1f523c4fe60962a4e71638ef5ee3d6065/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765624507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/767c3c2e33f00464b2f229cdb797ceb4f7921032/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765624507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845210/767c3c2e33f00464b2f229cdb797ceb4f7